  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "He was a reserved individual, clad in somber attire and sporting a wide-brimmed straw hat.",
      "output_sha256": "5e1d5139447b16c124502ca4b0f0d5e18f996a4eeb592d122debf7765adee1c3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": 0.427596,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        1
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "24e0f05db50a931579f30f54efb1fe85d231f4f6b61591e7813b8b4a1974987f"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_ai_sha256": "5e1d5139447b16c124502ca4b0f0d5e18f996a4eeb592d122debf7765adee1c3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        1,
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "His moustache and whiskers had a distinctly military air, yet his posture was uncharacteristically slouched, and his dreamy gaze seemed lost in thought.",
      "output_sha256": "9d64917c9110fcb9e1be63fe0fded51fbfa703ef213376f335b6c5b64b05ba50",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": 0.427596,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        1
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "24e0f05db50a931579f30f54efb1fe85d231f4f6b61591e7813b8b4a1974987f"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_ai_sha256": "9d64917c9110fcb9e1be63fe0fded51fbfa703ef213376f335b6c5b64b05ba50",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        1,
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "As our modest pleasure boat approached Yarmouth Harbour, he cast a gloomy yet curious glance at the chaotic array of small vessels that filled the waters.",
      "output_sha256": "cc372c74e7e9dfd12719641a185976237e0b62ee40c3018bc0ee2423be96d1ae",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": 0.343901,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        2
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "effa6dfda415b7bf6a13200317272e74d6e5b29bc65c75f0c9c0123ee830c0d5"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_ai_sha256": "cc372c74e7e9dfd12719641a185976237e0b62ee40c3018bc0ee2423be96d1ae",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "A boat entering this harbour, as every one knows, does not enter in front of the town like a foreigner, but creeps round at the back like a traitor taking the town in the rear.",
      "output_sha256": "8a515ce5054b8131aa008bf9c5bc6314334f06e2e39b1765112dd9c81d877880",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_human_sha256": "8a515ce5054b8131aa008bf9c5bc6314334f06e2e39b1765112dd9c81d877880",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The passage of the river seems almost too narrow for traffic, and in consequence the bigger ships look colossal.",
      "output_sha256": "8ff219b6ee003ba3d599b772975c272179a5dc1a20cd7303f5f2fef78306d29e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_human_sha256": "8ff219b6ee003ba3d599b772975c272179a5dc1a20cd7303f5f2fef78306d29e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "As we passed under a timber ship from Norway, which seemed to block up the heavens like a cathedral, the man in a straw hat pointed to an odd wooden figurehead carved like a woman, and said, like one continuing a conversation, “Now, why have they left off having them.",
      "output_sha256": "afc0e10e5c201de304814783b8c8e695ceb451d48fb85802601c76e9bd48573f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_human_sha256": "afc0e10e5c201de304814783b8c8e695ceb451d48fb85802601c76e9bd48573f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "They didn’t do any one any harm?”",
      "output_sha256": "5a6877db318bac28ba7366ab7e8fb28e3fb883eb3382a89da71ba49b3269db43",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_human_sha256": "5a6877db318bac28ba7366ab7e8fb28e3fb883eb3382a89da71ba49b3269db43",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I replied with some flippancy about the captain’s wife being jealous; but I knew in my heart that the man had struck a deep note.",
      "output_sha256": "d471e2cf2020403cc15671077c50f72e8dc8116f5ed323e25c7bed98280686b7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_human_sha256": "d471e2cf2020403cc15671077c50f72e8dc8116f5ed323e25c7bed98280686b7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "There has been something in our most recent civilisation which is mysteriously hostile to such healthy and humane symbols.",
      "output_sha256": "c69ecb2991d08593344c8e4f46b3b48004e688a69a710fe08d342f8b8be01c2b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_human_sha256": "c69ecb2991d08593344c8e4f46b3b48004e688a69a710fe08d342f8b8be01c2b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“They hate anything like that, which is human and pretty,” he continued, exactly echoing my thoughts.",
      "output_sha256": "2f8c0986998ef73136f1e45f11cc4a24f85ee03d27a4ab4e32ec987ac173f54b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_human_sha256": "2f8c0986998ef73136f1e45f11cc4a24f85ee03d27a4ab4e32ec987ac173f54b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "“I suspect they destroyed all the cheerful old figureheads with hatchets and took pleasure in it.”",
      "output_sha256": "77fa7b499ac9b252511e0036b38d66e5dbe6104aa03a2932fa33876960be3b83",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": 0.58625,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        10
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "3c3e54f637bd777c11ad592818b7379c5df951ae409a588693fcd56a4a17a753"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_ai_sha256": "77fa7b499ac9b252511e0036b38d66e5dbe6104aa03a2932fa33876960be3b83",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        11
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "“Like Mr. Quilp,” I replied, “when he smashed the wooden Admiral with a poker.”",
      "output_sha256": "612bf6b8bcc2ae24df4fbd4f46ac53d1b617a5588b8dc4f5a0256b37500ab718",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": 0.794481,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        11
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "37648388ea112aaf97333c481a39dedd1fc93f96261efcc11fd38939585d7e56"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_ai_sha256": "612bf6b8bcc2ae24df4fbd4f46ac53d1b617a5588b8dc4f5a0256b37500ab718",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        12
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "In an instant, his demeanor transformed; he straightened and looked me in the eye, fully engaged for the first time.",
      "output_sha256": "2d4d0089db80a3ee5d7a834dd8a42fecf9be927512d26e0ab44998b19d788756",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": 0.355439,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        12
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "5e02d3b55fd4f7c00b083f64f786902e4f54a5063ec796f97bf9c8d3639622ca"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_ai_sha256": "2d4d0089db80a3ee5d7a834dd8a42fecf9be927512d26e0ab44998b19d788756",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        13
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "“Do you come to Yarmouth for that?” he inquired.",
      "output_sha256": "d8b43ef16a618e64408e1600aac296319998c818103837c640125ebc81929d5e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": 0.83,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        13
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "28611e1da754bee36aa824317d5c935dfd2bf364403231a2a788afface036ed6"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_ai_sha256": "d8b43ef16a618e64408e1600aac296319998c818103837c640125ebc81929d5e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        14
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“For what?”",
      "output_sha256": "93b5aed5c80e35ccf1427eb75cd2ad41269c9f333722fdb5442f93a473ee2aab",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_human_sha256": "93b5aed5c80e35ccf1427eb75cd2ad41269c9f333722fdb5442f93a473ee2aab",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“For Dickens,” he answered, and drummed with his foot on the deck.",
      "output_sha256": "d3acab2d0840bbad487088cc6bfa5990312b49e47b78566928ab58f504988b24",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_human_sha256": "d3acab2d0840bbad487088cc6bfa5990312b49e47b78566928ab58f504988b24",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“No,” I answered; “I come for fun, though that is much the same thing.”",
      "output_sha256": "477dcb4d3f8c4aa81e6add45aee510df4223e3a323673945890fee7ebb8a0d31",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_human_sha256": "477dcb4d3f8c4aa81e6add45aee510df4223e3a323673945890fee7ebb8a0d31",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“I always come,” he answered quietly, “to find Peggotty’s boat.",
      "output_sha256": "4ee811c0af81f71a2e70f51725452c382c6a09b85444104d18eb295fd808208c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_human_sha256": "4ee811c0af81f71a2e70f51725452c382c6a09b85444104d18eb295fd808208c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It isn’t here.”",
      "output_sha256": "318a49483d8edeba04fb8a9c73086462455087a7ac2153fa1de57d5a514e20c5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_human_sha256": "318a49483d8edeba04fb8a9c73086462455087a7ac2153fa1de57d5a514e20c5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "And when he said that I understood him perfectly.",
      "output_sha256": "480e3e88c0a35625d5aa1eab9e584cd93d536d30e39c213cfab2e137af1482b1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_human_sha256": "480e3e88c0a35625d5aa1eab9e584cd93d536d30e39c213cfab2e137af1482b1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "There are two Yarmouths; I daresay there are two hundred to the people who live there.",
      "output_sha256": "833c50c28d7e29a560013533bc9bd0038c1747b41bf93266d1b4dbcd5acd177c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_human_sha256": "833c50c28d7e29a560013533bc9bd0038c1747b41bf93266d1b4dbcd5acd177c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "For myself, I have yet to exhaust the list of Batterseas.",
      "output_sha256": "ba12a02be6d83513e9a7b7ca8e6efc0e2cc5d557fea9b1981e4be730607482c9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": 0.569231,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        21
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "17b1536bb3575be1c92d75c32c74ad1143281afdf9ec1f74fc60f4e80fc2fe5f"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_ai_sha256": "ba12a02be6d83513e9a7b7ca8e6efc0e2cc5d557fea9b1981e4be730607482c9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But there are two to the stranger and tourist; the poor part, which is dignified, and the prosperous part, which is savagely vulgar.",
      "output_sha256": "de80e10bd183bf2e589472faddf30629b098afc0069fa28e66b18aca4506fd58",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_human_sha256": "de80e10bd183bf2e589472faddf30629b098afc0069fa28e66b18aca4506fd58",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "My new friend haunted the first of these like a ghost; to the latter he would only distantly allude.",
      "output_sha256": "327897941bbdc905fdd572721e60c0a9c073a432b12b8d5469f70d9438f84f49",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_human_sha256": "327897941bbdc905fdd572721e60c0a9c073a432b12b8d5469f70d9438f84f49",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“The place is very much spoilt now... trippers, you know,” he would say, not at all scornfully, but simply sadly.",
      "output_sha256": "568c0afb22049c656433360a7d01859d3af5658624341b049ebd4cebcb2ac39e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_human_sha256": "568c0afb22049c656433360a7d01859d3af5658624341b049ebd4cebcb2ac39e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "That was the nearest he would go to an admission of the monstrous watering place that lay along the front, outblazing the sun, and more deafening than the sea.",
      "output_sha256": "200a568186c4f84d8b3bca5405f98109c92a376fac5ac0f7c4d0423fffdee604",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_human_sha256": "200a568186c4f84d8b3bca5405f98109c92a376fac5ac0f7c4d0423fffdee604",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "But beyond this hubbub—out of earshot—were narrow lanes that felt like secret pathways leading to hidden sanctuaries of tranquility.",
      "output_sha256": "b281061d65ea8cf8ab9c19087f702bb8a340e3e2d57980155f236c37c03496ca",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": 0.533217,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        26
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f68bb3687333b651a9e942b24353fd9ac6da5dc325354897f13b90a6d0dbf8de"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_ai_sha256": "b281061d65ea8cf8ab9c19087f702bb8a340e3e2d57980155f236c37c03496ca",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        28
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "We wandered through squares filled with such profound silence that entering one felt akin to diving into a serene pool.",
      "output_sha256": "eb920dd2f15b747c1ba62a4539f67e8eeca2608ccd8184e06c242a5f8cca2ed5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": 0.436447,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        27
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "14b2377e55bb19a773831e4c105b6e0b727cf4315eb81b6935f11b177d477657"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_ai_sha256": "eb920dd2f15b747c1ba62a4539f67e8eeca2608ccd8184e06c242a5f8cca2ed5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        29
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "In these places the man and I paced up and down talking about Dickens, or, rather, doing what all true Dickensians do, telling each other verbatim long passages which both of us knew quite well already.",
      "output_sha256": "d3681ca06b9472c5548974094d7e5be362515308956cce9fb1605c460a61e0b4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_human_sha256": "d3681ca06b9472c5548974094d7e5be362515308956cce9fb1605c460a61e0b4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "We were really in the atmosphere of the older England.",
      "output_sha256": "eaffe3480b8031f1740e9e23c81fbc000f2703bab207e7921237a979beff8928",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_human_sha256": "eaffe3480b8031f1740e9e23c81fbc000f2703bab207e7921237a979beff8928",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Fishermen passed us who might well have been characters like Peggotty; we went into a musty curiosity shop and bought pipe-stoppers carved into figures from Pickwick.",
      "output_sha256": "47cedc2ed6fb7f788a5d2d08ff9a2a907136b4c36c22746ee58aa8d51caffad5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_human_sha256": "47cedc2ed6fb7f788a5d2d08ff9a2a907136b4c36c22746ee58aa8d51caffad5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The evening was settling down between all the buildings with that slow gold that seems to soak everything when we went into the church.",
      "output_sha256": "4f0cb784d9a47f6ef7775d9cbcd31c7ea7d5fc2b617949626c0a92a4fe210e25",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_human_sha256": "4f0cb784d9a47f6ef7775d9cbcd31c7ea7d5fc2b617949626c0a92a4fe210e25",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "In the growing darkness of the church, my eye caught the coloured windows which on that clear golden evening were flaming with all the passionate heraldry of the most fierce and ecstatic of Christian arts.",
      "output_sha256": "14e2ff19ee058ae44fa5a6949580c8b6dac17e5dfaa0125b95f79b45c95558ea",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_human_sha256": "14e2ff19ee058ae44fa5a6949580c8b6dac17e5dfaa0125b95f79b45c95558ea",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "At length I said to my companion:",
      "output_sha256": "d6b4ad2c855bba06ba830e07f162d95e56eece5b0e40fff23d584b31748d734d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_human_sha256": "d6b4ad2c855bba06ba830e07f162d95e56eece5b0e40fff23d584b31748d734d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 15,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“Do you see that angel over there?",
      "output_sha256": "e296e6a1048e33d11e3bfc97c6e27e227d2de897098168c16693c4a1fb06c42f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_human_sha256": "e296e6a1048e33d11e3bfc97c6e27e227d2de897098168c16693c4a1fb06c42f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 15,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I think it must be meant for the angel at the sepulchre.”",
      "output_sha256": "865e1120c4caedb6370ea1cedf40085dd0da2ac6264c9301e4e50c8f269c57b4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_human_sha256": "865e1120c4caedb6370ea1cedf40085dd0da2ac6264c9301e4e50c8f269c57b4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 16,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Noticing my unusual emotional response, he raised his eyebrows.",
      "output_sha256": "36e7a880f5ae8452418442d56b1280df264843cbbf1d6967148ebe2961087daa",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": 0.362098,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        36
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "bdf8481706c6a127f42adfe61d8425e0d541e18a3dcff69968c6238d6e4d7e78"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_ai_sha256": "36e7a880f5ae8452418442d56b1280df264843cbbf1d6967148ebe2961087daa",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        38
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 17,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "“I suppose,” he replied.",
      "output_sha256": "6d95111b50f5aaf5f46b95528fbb7a449b2755418f12aea1611a8ce13fee9390",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": 0.45,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        37
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "8da01d72ce0f2618d8ef46aabaf54d9b6c23fd24497dea5fbd36d3ad91363958"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_ai_sha256": "6d95111b50f5aaf5f46b95528fbb7a449b2755418f12aea1611a8ce13fee9390",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        39
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 17,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“What is there odd about that?”",
      "output_sha256": "f8a96745c1d4d4d6c84fe49f47a3f0126577498dcdfaae379831628f608ffc35",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_human_sha256": "f8a96745c1d4d4d6c84fe49f47a3f0126577498dcdfaae379831628f608ffc35",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 18,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "After a moment of contemplation, I asked, “Do you recall what the angel at the sepulchre said?”",
      "output_sha256": "03db49e3125eceace09ff3479bd18c148b0594f5a895720ca596daf351c5d4b3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": 0.713971,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        39
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "94682925e36046f206afb32c456a1be0822bdcacb695ac3eef8fdfa48749f703"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 41,
      "source_ai_sha256": "03db49e3125eceace09ff3479bd18c148b0594f5a895720ca596daf351c5d4b3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        41
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 19,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“Not particularly,” he answered; “but where are you off to in such a hurry?”",
      "output_sha256": "9f003127048cca68850be3f3f6d35fae0c6886ec4dbc036b49cb4cd0620e6d6e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_human_sha256": "9f003127048cca68850be3f3f6d35fae0c6886ec4dbc036b49cb4cd0620e6d6e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 42,
      "paragraph_index": 20,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "I briskly led him out of the tranquil square, past the fishermen’s almshouses, heading toward the coast, while he continued to question my abrupt departure.",
      "output_sha256": "49c81889d56d9076f02f62914a27f4d04234815e879b33ccedc30edb541f498e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": 0.539776,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        41
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a65f15c708a4b959ff24e493fe621745422819add34f87fd35fb8fb5d55b94e4"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 43,
      "source_ai_sha256": "49c81889d56d9076f02f62914a27f4d04234815e879b33ccedc30edb541f498e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        43
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 43,
      "paragraph_index": 21,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "“I am going,” I explained, “to feed coins into automatic machines on the beach.",
      "output_sha256": "49fede9c64ee4f804deb4f1764a461e5025d243a8879cc058d495cd0ec8953ea",
      "alignment_unit_index": 43,
      "alignment_score": 0.671429,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        42
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a0114cdee0cedb9ac6833202fdaeccc80d9f7cd48aba2a68504c89a73c9f39ea"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 44,
      "source_ai_sha256": "49fede9c64ee4f804deb4f1764a461e5025d243a8879cc058d495cd0ec8953ea",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        44
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 44,
      "paragraph_index": 21,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I am going to listen to the niggers.",
      "output_sha256": "84ed95fd3e5fed0c3aed62c936e4514afe5b6ad7aa1c5d3214b25f9433332ba1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 44,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 43,
      "source_human_sha256": "84ed95fd3e5fed0c3aed62c936e4514afe5b6ad7aa1c5d3214b25f9433332ba1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 45,
      "paragraph_index": 21,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I am going to have my photograph taken.",
      "output_sha256": "b6f844c5340db634185288f5e1aeede022700c0d46e60d42eaa98910c233d7e3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 45,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 44,
      "source_human_sha256": "b6f844c5340db634185288f5e1aeede022700c0d46e60d42eaa98910c233d7e3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 46,
      "paragraph_index": 21,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "I plan to drink ginger beer from its original bottle.",
      "output_sha256": "8fe5ad64e5a51fdcdd076335be309f6f63c4c4aeca41a4365a2f24a91e84877c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 46,
      "alignment_score": 0.553961,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        45
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "81e4adf3542d8cdaedb8dd90a4e88fc4b966e547d39c02cbb55e3a5461a55b90"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 47,
      "source_ai_sha256": "8fe5ad64e5a51fdcdd076335be309f6f63c4c4aeca41a4365a2f24a91e84877c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        47
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 47,
      "paragraph_index": 21,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "I will buy some postcards, and I am eager for a boat ride.",
      "output_sha256": "1a88cc1657f7abf257be03de3b6f3745ac48fa16a026f5fe118c397678cf375b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 47,
      "alignment_score": 0.630594,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        46,
        47
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "5ac5e23feb67b7c04368203e8aa962aff34639b0ca280934c0c45934600459b1",
        "eb7255abcc26467f3337b442961c766fb023e5bc92b5c3f6c14639111546d632"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 48,
      "source_ai_sha256": "1a88cc1657f7abf257be03de3b6f3745ac48fa16a026f5fe118c397678cf375b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        48
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 48,
      "paragraph_index": 21,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I am ready to listen to a concertina, and but for the defects of my education should be ready to play it.",
      "output_sha256": "f96c10447e7af5e0ceea7dfaf94437f5ca229beba8e10cd9ea980356f1d8a51a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 48,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 48,
      "source_human_sha256": "f96c10447e7af5e0ceea7dfaf94437f5ca229beba8e10cd9ea980356f1d8a51a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 49,
      "paragraph_index": 21,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I am willing to ride on a donkey; that is, if the donkey is willing.",
      "output_sha256": "d0f09d7492db9b1ccbc0988b70c3b983b57555dcaa8515df7204ae53c718bba2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 49,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 49,
      "source_human_sha256": "d0f09d7492db9b1ccbc0988b70c3b983b57555dcaa8515df7204ae53c718bba2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 50,
      "paragraph_index": 21,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I am willing to be a donkey; for all this was commanded me by the angel in the stained-glass window.”",
      "output_sha256": "bfbc94519816efba33dd2cc6185f0d003f4c5ba445c034f07c3a0f47352f2f54",
      "alignment_unit_index": 50,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 50,
      "source_human_sha256": "bfbc94519816efba33dd2cc6185f0d003f4c5ba445c034f07c3a0f47352f2f54",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 51,
      "paragraph_index": 22,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "“I really think,” he said thoughtfully, “it would be best to put you in the care of your relatives.”",
      "output_sha256": "16a38d28a6cbde6f64fd321544941c47ce472b8904da885141a8303e1636983e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 51,
      "alignment_score": 0.496255,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        51
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a4ab18118255e463b278ad890fb3265055be6bf20f7961654d1579b1dc90a873"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 52,
      "source_ai_sha256": "16a38d28a6cbde6f64fd321544941c47ce472b8904da885141a8303e1636983e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        52
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 52,
      "paragraph_index": 23,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“Sir,” I answered, “there are certain writers to whom humanity owes much, whose talent is yet of so shy or delicate or retrospective a type that we do well to link it with certain quaint places or certain perishing associations.",
      "output_sha256": "8a27e956dae50f1d712aef1b46d5aa32808e1bb72cbebec4442993e61fd489d5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 52,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 52,
      "source_human_sha256": "8a27e956dae50f1d712aef1b46d5aa32808e1bb72cbebec4442993e61fd489d5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 53,
      "paragraph_index": 23,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "It wouldn’t be unusual to seek the essence of Horace Walpole at Strawberry Hill or to find Thackeray’s spirit lingering in Old Kensington.",
      "output_sha256": "d283c79dd5d73d72bfc81b665144ed01dd418a9361fec31fcf168eace46e22d8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 53,
      "alignment_score": 0.589066,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        53
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "2a98aeed0cebc47e7f40b1854ba1007152ffacf6e806453a6d1bef2a13bbeaee"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 54,
      "source_ai_sha256": "d283c79dd5d73d72bfc81b665144ed01dd418a9361fec31fcf168eace46e22d8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        54
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 54,
      "paragraph_index": 23,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But let us have no antiquarianism about Dickens, for Dickens is not an antiquity.",
      "output_sha256": "7cae21820e14574fa238dcb0009ee3d1feb1ad9ce45eed2b9fd0346001c6c688",
      "alignment_unit_index": 54,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 54,
      "source_human_sha256": "7cae21820e14574fa238dcb0009ee3d1feb1ad9ce45eed2b9fd0346001c6c688",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 55,
      "paragraph_index": 23,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Dickens looks not backward, but forward; he might look at our modern mobs with satire, or with fury, but he would love to look at them.",
      "output_sha256": "18cd7450aba670e253142cd46e00e98aafd61ff56be1ef92998892ea56702cc1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 55,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 55,
      "source_human_sha256": "18cd7450aba670e253142cd46e00e98aafd61ff56be1ef92998892ea56702cc1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 56,
      "paragraph_index": 23,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "He might lash our democracy, but it would be because, like a democrat, he asked much from it.",
      "output_sha256": "b304bdb713c82c4ec453c2ae39d66b6590da1759aeca665b12ec8fc56c95f08e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 56,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 56,
      "source_human_sha256": "b304bdb713c82c4ec453c2ae39d66b6590da1759aeca665b12ec8fc56c95f08e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 57,
      "paragraph_index": 23,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "We will not have all his books bound up under the title of ‘The Old Curiosity Shop.’",
      "output_sha256": "84b35bacb10acab8d7b2556f05503a0cb90f12f42066704f7398dcc17078b21f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 57,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 57,
      "source_human_sha256": "84b35bacb10acab8d7b2556f05503a0cb90f12f42066704f7398dcc17078b21f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 58,
      "paragraph_index": 23,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Rather we will have them all bound up under the title of ‘Great Expectations.’",
      "output_sha256": "d11da10d2503525032542ec6f3e703686c51fdaefe8041812e98aa30582d797e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 57,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 58,
      "source_human_sha256": "d11da10d2503525032542ec6f3e703686c51fdaefe8041812e98aa30582d797e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 59,
      "paragraph_index": 23,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Wherever humanity exists, he would urge us to confront it, to embrace it with a fervent passion, and to digest it with the appetite of a giant.",
      "output_sha256": "18d903511b6b2220a7e478728e7cf5018904797964c8e82a97a500901e5a15d3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 58,
      "alignment_score": 0.564778,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        59
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "dc654259c2378b54c554a112cdc9dff678e91ef984b56840a7089138855b9f0f"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 60,
      "source_ai_sha256": "18d903511b6b2220a7e478728e7cf5018904797964c8e82a97a500901e5a15d3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 60,
      "paragraph_index": 23,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "We must take these trippers as he would have taken them, and tear out of them their tragedy and their farce.",
      "output_sha256": "97748c59734c4a1c5a5eb6666cfed3eb492c6e54d3cd0b5a9a0ef1bd854cad04",
      "alignment_unit_index": 59,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 60,
      "source_human_sha256": "97748c59734c4a1c5a5eb6666cfed3eb492c6e54d3cd0b5a9a0ef1bd854cad04",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 61,
      "paragraph_index": 23,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Do you now remember what the angel proclaimed at the sepulchre?",
      "output_sha256": "f44829bfcd8da0368ffdffb72e4f3443707e567e8c1f4b19947829cf2e9258a7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 60,
      "alignment_score": 0.843182,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        61
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "6b779956c10ca5148385c4489b9ab3cf5a67e718a1aa873ed9da38323275a43c"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 62,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f44829bfcd8da0368ffdffb72e4f3443707e567e8c1f4b19947829cf2e9258a7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        62
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 62,
      "paragraph_index": 23,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "‘Why seek ye the living among the dead?",
      "output_sha256": "d0e852fc6bb2b755c2a37c0a4f5a9944beb3d3a51c8d021dacf7976cb4360a4b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 61,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 62,
      "source_human_sha256": "d0e852fc6bb2b755c2a37c0a4f5a9944beb3d3a51c8d021dacf7976cb4360a4b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 63,
      "paragraph_index": 23,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "He is not here; he is risen.’”",
      "output_sha256": "5cc604c69467d7d6f6c9af897b0f0cfa744c0b0a2f7b26a0e09621f66832ff43",
      "alignment_unit_index": 62,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 63,
      "source_human_sha256": "5cc604c69467d7d6f6c9af897b0f0cfa744c0b0a2f7b26a0e09621f66832ff43",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 64,
      "paragraph_index": 24,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "With that we came out suddenly on the wide stretch of the sands, which were black with the knobs and masses of our laughing and quite desperate democracy.",
      "output_sha256": "d73cd77a4a3d5a7ca0a3831678274bf594baffd02b1f797ac384761071fe6a0d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 63,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 64,
      "source_human_sha256": "d73cd77a4a3d5a7ca0a3831678274bf594baffd02b1f797ac384761071fe6a0d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 65,
      "paragraph_index": 24,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "And the sunset, which was now in its final glory, flung far over all of them a red flush and glitter like the gigantic firelight of Dickens.",
      "output_sha256": "2b0ac078fbf4989d6a36c919b0c015a8b7a6386a9a98d232e4b14569176e8882",
      "alignment_unit_index": 64,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 65,
      "source_human_sha256": "2b0ac078fbf4989d6a36c919b0c015a8b7a6386a9a98d232e4b14569176e8882",
